---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Detached Garage Builders in Calgary | Back Lane Garage Co"
  description="Garage building in Calgary: compare written quotes from independent detached garage builders in Calgary, Airdrie, Cochrane, Okotoks and Chestermere. Call now."
  canonical="https://backlanegarage.ca/"
>
<Fragment slot="head">
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@type": ["HomeAndConstructionBusiness", "LocalBusiness"], "@id": "https://backlanegarage.ca/#organization", "name": "Back Lane Garage Co", "url": "https://backlanegarage.ca", "logo": {"@type": "ImageObject", "url": "https://backlanegarage.ca/images/og-image.webp"}, "priceRange": "$$", "telephone": "(403) 555-0162", "email": "info@backlanegarage.ca", "address": {"@type": "PostalAddress", "addressLocality": "Calgary", "addressRegion": "AB", "addressCountry": "CA"}, "geo": {"@type": "GeoCoordinates", "latitude": 51.0447, "longitude": -114.0719}, "areaServed": [{"@type": "City", "name": "Calgary", "addressRegion": "AB"}, {"@type": "City", "name": "Airdrie", "addressRegion": "AB"}, {"@type": "City", "name": "Cochrane", "addressRegion": "AB"}, {"@type": "City", "name": "Okotoks", "addressRegion": "AB"}, {"@type": "City", "name": "Chestermere", "addressRegion": "AB"}, {"@type": "City", "name": "Rocky View County", "addressRegion": "AB"}], "@context": "https://schema.org", "description": "Garage building in Calgary: compare written quotes from independent detached garage builders in Calgary, Airdrie, Cochrane, Okotoks and Chestermere. Call now.", "image": "https://backlanegarage.ca/images/og-image.webp", "hasOfferCatalog": {"@type": "OfferCatalog", "name": "Garage Building Services", "itemListElement": [{"@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": {"@type": "Service", "name": "Detached Garage Builders"}}, {"@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": {"@type": "Service", "name": "Garage Packages"}}, {"@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": {"@type": "Service", "name": "Custom and Oversized Garages"}}, {"@type": "Offer", "itemOffered": {"@type": "Service", "name": "Garage Replacement"}}]}}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "WebSite", "@id": "https://backlanegarage.ca/#website", "url": "https://backlanegarage.ca", "name": "Back Lane Garage Co", "publisher": {"@id": "https://backlanegarage.ca/#organization"}}</script>
<script type="application/ld+json">{"@context": "https://schema.org", "@type": "FAQPage", "mainEntity": [{"@type": "Question", "name": "How do garage prices and scoping work?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Each independent builder sets its own price; this site does not quote. Calgary builders advertise package starting prices, for example Corsac Construction lists a 22' x 22' double at $27,500 plus GST and Venkor Group lists a 22 x 22 double at $30126, while Precision Construction & Decora describes a finished double at $55,000 to $90,000. Package inclusions differ, so ask each builder to write down the size, slab, framing, door, electrical and whether permits are in the price."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "How quickly will a builder respond, and how long does a build take?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "This site does not guarantee a response time, because each builder keeps its own schedule. Ask when the written proposal will arrive and when work could start. The City of Calgary says a building permit review takes approximately 7 days, or 10 to 12 weeks if a development permit is needed, and that neither is guaranteed. Sahi Contracting says most builds take 3 to 5 weeks once permits are in hand, while Falcon Contracting says 4 to 8 weeks from excavation to inspection."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do I need a permit for a detached garage in Calgary?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "The City of Calgary says a detached garage over 10 square metres (107 sq. ft.) needs a building permit, and a separate electrical permit for lights and the door opener. A development permit is also needed in some cases, for example a garage over 75 square metres (807 sq. ft.) or higher than 4.6 metres. Confirm your lot with the City before you commit to a design."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Is Back Lane Garage Co a garage builder?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "No. It advertises independent garage builders and does not build, employ crews, pull permits or hold a contracting licence. A builder that accepts deposits or progress payments from homeowners before the work is finished may need a provincial licence. Service Alberta has a search where you can check whether a business is licensed."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Can a garage be built in winter?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Some builders say yes. Falcon Contracting says winter builds are possible with specialized concrete techniques and may cost slightly more for heating, and Hammerhead Construction says concrete needs winter heat to pour. Hammerhead also notes that more projects are completed in summer, so demand for labour can be higher. Asking for quotes in winter gives you time to plan a spring or summer build."}}, {"@type": "Question", "name": "Do the rules differ outside Calgary?", "acceptedAnswer": {"@type": "Answer", "text": "Yes. Airdrie, Cochrane, Okotoks, Chestermere and Rocky View County each publish their own permit rules, fees and setbacks, and some of those details differ from the City of Calgary's. Start with the page for your town and confirm the current rules with the municipality before you sign anything."}}]}</script>
<style is:global>
  .rich p { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich ul { padding-left: 20px; margin: 0 0 16px; }
  .rich li { font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.8; color: #555; margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .rich strong { color: #2B3A44; }
  .rich a { color: #B85C1E; font-weight: 600; text-decoration: none; }
  .rich a:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
</style>
</Fragment>

<!-- HERO -->
<section style="position:relative;min-height:560px;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;text-align:center;overflow:hidden;">
  <img src="/images/hero-panorama.webp" alt="Calgary landscape" width="2000" height="950" style="position:absolute;inset:0;width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;" loading="eager" fetchpriority="high">
  <div style="position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(10,61,92,0.55) 0%, rgba(10,61,92,0.25) 55%, rgba(10,61,92,0.45) 100%);"></div>
  <div style="position:relative;max-width:880px;padding:96px 24px 130px;">
    <span style="display:inline-block;margin-bottom:18px;padding:7px 18px;border-radius:2px;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:12px;font-weight:800;letter-spacing:0.16em;text-transform:uppercase;background:rgba(255,255,255,0.14);color:#fff;border:1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.35);backdrop-filter:blur(3px);">Independent builders · Calgary and area</span>
    <h1 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-weight:800;color:#fff;line-height:1.08;letter-spacing:-0.015em;font-size:clamp(32px,5vw,58px);margin:0 0 18px;text-shadow:0 2px 24px rgba(10,61,92,0.45);">Detached Garage Building in Calgary: Compare Independent Builders' Written Quotes</h1>
    <p style="font-size:18px;line-height:1.7;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.92);max-width:640px;margin:0 auto 30px;text-shadow:0 1px 12px rgba(10,61,92,0.5);">Back Lane Garage Co is an advertising site that puts Calgary homeowners in touch with independent detached garage builders in Calgary, Airdrie, Cochrane, Okotoks, Chestermere and Rocky View County. Call now and describe your lot and lane access, and the builder who takes your enquiry quotes the job and contracts with you directly.</p>
    <div style="display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:16px;flex-wrap:wrap;">
      <a href="tel:+14035550162" class="btn-green" style="font-size:15px;padding:16px 38px;">Call Now — (403) 555-0162</a>
      <a href="/#contact" class="btn-white-outline" style="font-size:15px;">Get a Written Quote</a>
    </div>
  </div>
  <svg class="swoosh" style="position:absolute;bottom:0;left:0;" viewBox="0 0 1440 70" preserveAspectRatio="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M0,70 C360,10 1080,10 1440,70 L1440,70 L0,70 Z" fill="#ffffff"/></svg>
</section>

<!-- INTRO -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px 64px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="intro-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:0.9fr 1.1fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div style="position:relative;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 24px 56px rgba(10,61,92,0.22);aspect-ratio:1/1;">
        <img src="/images/about.webp" alt="Back Lane Garage Co service crew" width="1024" height="1024" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="position:absolute;bottom:-18px;right:-14px;background:#B85C1E;color:#fff;border-radius:14px;padding:14px 22px;box-shadow:0 10px 26px rgba(47,163,77,0.4);">
        <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;margin:0;line-height:1;">Jan-Apr</p>
        <p style="font-size:11.5px;font-weight:700;margin:4px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.06em;text-transform:uppercase;">Planning Season</p>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">Calgary detached garages</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 18px;">Garage building in Calgary, explained before you ask anyone for a price</h2>
      <div class="rich"><p>Back Lane Garage Co is advertising for independent Calgary garage builders. It builds nothing, holds no licence and does not take deposits, so you quote and contract directly with the builder you choose. It collects the Calgary numbers in one place: what builders advertise, what the City charges and what the rules say.</p><p>Most people here are deciding between a <a href='/detached-garages/'>new detached garage</a>, a <a href='/garage-packages/'>garage package</a>, a <a href='/custom-garages/'>custom or oversized build</a> or a <a href='/garage-replacement/'>replacement for an old garage</a>. Read the <a href='/garage-building-cost-calgary/'>garage building cost page</a> first, since published prices from different builders rarely cover the same inclusions.</p></div>
      <a href="/about/" class="btn-blue" style="margin-top:10px;">More About Us</a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .intro-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; gap: 44px !important; } }
</style>

<!-- TILES -->
