  <div style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">Where people usually start</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 40px;">Where does a Calgary garage project usually get stuck?</h2>
    <div class="tile-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:22px;">
      <a href="/detached-garages/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border-radius:16px;overflow:hidden;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 4px 16px rgba(10,61,92,0.1);">
        <img src="/images/service-1.webp" alt="New detached garage at the back of a Calgary lot with lane access" width="700" height="560" style="width:100%;aspect-ratio:1.25/1;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
        <span style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:14.5px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;padding:14px 12px;">Building a new detached garage</span>
