<!-- SERVICE CARDS -->
<section style="padding:0 24px 80px;background:#F3F2EE;">
  <div style="max-width:1100px;margin:0 auto;">
    <div class="svc-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(4,1fr);gap:20px;">
      <a href="/detached-garages/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 10px;">Detached Garage Builders</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Independent Calgary builders quote new single, double and triple detached garages on a slab, with framing, siding, roof, overhead door and electrical. Ask for the same size and inclusions from two or three of them.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B85C1E;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/garage-packages/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 10px;">Garage Packages</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">Many builders advertise a package price for a standard wood-frame garage, but what is in the package differs from firm to firm. Here is what to line up side by side first.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B85C1E;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/custom-garages/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 10px;">Custom and Oversized Garages</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">A taller door, a deeper bay for a truck or a heated workshop changes the quote and sometimes the permit. Know what to ask a builder before you settle on a size.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B85C1E;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
      <a href="/garage-replacement/" style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;background:#fff;border:1px solid #E2DED6;border-radius:12px;padding:30px 26px;text-decoration:none;box-shadow:0 2px 8px rgba(14,77,110,0.06);">
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:20px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 10px;">Garage Replacement</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#555;margin:0 0 18px;flex:1;">A 1950s to 1970s garage that sags, leaks or will not fit a modern vehicle is often better replaced than repaired. The City of Calgary says demolishing the old garage is included in the permit for its replacement.</p>
        <span style="font-size:13px;font-weight:700;color:#B85C1E;letter-spacing:0.04em;text-transform:uppercase;">Learn More &#8594;</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
<style>
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2,1fr) !important; } }
  @media (max-width: 600px) { .svc-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr !important; } }
</style>

<!-- WHY -->
<section style="padding:84px 24px;background:#fff;">
  <div class="why-grid" style="max-width:1120px;margin:0 auto;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1.1fr 0.9fr;gap:64px;align-items:center;">
    <div>
      <span class="kicker">What Makes Us Different</span>
      <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,40px);margin:0 0 28px;">Why line up written quotes before the spring rush</h2>
      <ul style="list-style:none;padding:0;margin:0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B85C1E" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 4px;">Every figure names its source</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Prices on this site are what a named Calgary builder advertises, not a quote from us. Permit fees and rules come from City of Calgary pages read on 30 September 2026.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B85C1E" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 4px;">Permit facts you can check</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">The City's 2026 fee for a new garage building permit is $333.84, and a garage over 10 square metres needs one. Confirm your own lot with the City, because this site cannot approve anything.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B85C1E" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 4px;">Built around comparing quotes</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Ask each builder for the same size, slab, door and electrical work in writing, so the numbers line up when they arrive.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
          <li style="display:flex;gap:14px;align-items:flex-start;">
            <svg width="22" height="22" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="#B85C1E" stroke-width="2.6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="flex-shrink:0;margin-top:3px;"><polyline points="20 6 9 17 4 12"/></svg>
            <div>
              <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:17px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 4px;">Calgary and five surrounding areas</p>
              <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Airdrie, Cochrane, Okotoks, Chestermere and Rocky View County each run their own permit rules, and each has its own page here.</p>
            </div>
          </li>
      </ul>
    </div>
    <div style="display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:20px;">
      <div style="border-radius:18px;overflow:hidden;box-shadow:0 18px 44px rgba(10,61,92,0.2);aspect-ratio:4/5;">
        <img src="/images/hero-800.webp" alt="Back Lane Garage Co at work" width="800" height="800" style="width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;display:block;" loading="lazy">
      </div>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:20px;">
        <div style="background:#B85C1E;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;text-align:center;">
          <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0;line-height:1;">2-3</p>
          <p style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin:6px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;">Quotes to compare</p>
        </div>
        <div style="background:#B85C1E;border-radius:14px;padding:24px;text-align:center;">
          <p style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:26px;font-weight:800;color:#fff;margin:0;line-height:1;">Jan-Apr</p>
          <p style="font-size:12.5px;font-weight:700;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.85);margin:6px 0 0;letter-spacing:0.05em;text-transform:uppercase;">Planning season</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
