<!-- PROCESS -->
<section style="padding:76px 24px;background:#F3F2EE;">
  <div style="max-width:1020px;margin:0 auto;text-align:center;">
    <span class="kicker">How It Works</span>
    <h2 class="section-heading" style="font-size:clamp(26px,3.4vw,38px);margin:0 0 44px;">Three Steps: Plan, Quote, Build.</h2>
    <div class="steps-grid" style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:32px;">
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B85C1E;color:#fff;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">1</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 10px;">Enquiry and a plain conversation</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">Call now and describe your lot, your lane access, what you park today and what you want inside the garage. A builder takes the enquiry from there.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B85C1E;color:#fff;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">2</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 10px;">Site survey and scope</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">The builder looks at the lot, the lane, the old structure if there is one, and the setbacks, then agrees the size, slab, door and electrical with you.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="background:#fff;border-radius:16px;padding:34px 26px;box-shadow:0 4px 18px rgba(10,61,92,0.08);">
        <div style="width:54px;height:54px;border-radius:50%;background:#B85C1E;color:#fff;font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:22px;font-weight:800;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;margin:0 auto 16px;">3</div>
        <h3 style="font-family:'Inter',sans-serif;font-size:18px;font-weight:800;color:#17191C;margin:0 0 10px;">Written proposal and delivery</h3>
        <p style="font-size:14.5px;line-height:1.7;color:#5A6B76;margin:0;">You get a written proposal and compare it with the others. You contract directly with the builder you choose, and the City says the person hired to do the work applies for the permit.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>
